                                    aria-labelledby="flush-heading-group-size">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        <p>Tours are limited to a maximum of six guests.</p>
                                        <p>The smaller group gives guests more room, more direct access to the crew, and more opportunity to enjoy the sharks without spending the experience crowded among a large group of swimmers.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!--// accordion item - Group size -->

